---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { articles } from '../lib/content';
const stories=(await articles()).filter(a=>/climate|wildlife|environment|conservation|biodiversity/i.test(a.category?.title||'') || /\b(climate|wildlife|biodiversity|drought|heatwave|coral reefs?|endangered species|mangroves)\b/i.test(a.title)).sort((a,b)=>Date.parse(b.publishedAt)-Date.parse(a.publishedAt));
---
<Layout title="Climate Change & Wildlife | ATHENA" description="Reporting on a changing climate, wildlife and the communities that depend on thriving ecosystems.">
<main class="desk"><p class="eyebrow">ATHENA / ENVIRONMENT</p><h1>Climate Change &amp; Wildlife</h1><p class="standfirst">From the farms that feed families to the wetlands that shelter wildlife, follow the places where a changing climate touches daily life.</p><h2>Latest reporting</h2>{stories.length ? <div class="grid">{stories.map(a=><article><p class="eyebrow">{a.category.title} · <time datetime={a.publishedAt}>{new Date(a.publishedAt).toLocaleDateString('en-GB',{timeZone:'Africa/Kampala',dateStyle:'long'})}</time></p><h3><a href={'/article/'+a.slug.current+'/'}>{a.title}</a></h3>{a.subtitle && <p>{a.subtitle}</p>}</article>)}</div> : <p>ATHENA’s climate and wildlife reporting will appear here as stories are published.</p>}<h2>Explore the beat</h2><div class="grid"><article><h3>Climate &amp; communities</h3><p>How heat, rainfall and changing seasons affect water, livelihoods, schools and health.</p></article><article><h3>Wildlife &amp; habitats</h3><p>Species, the landscapes they depend on, and the people working to protect both.</p></article></div></main>
</Layout>
<style>.desk{max-width:1080px;margin:2rem auto;padding:1.5rem;border-top:5px solid #a91935}.desk h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,6vw,4.6rem);line-height:1.08}.desk h2{margin-top:2.5rem}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:1.2rem}.grid article{border-top:1px solid #aaa;padding:1rem 0}.grid a{color:inherit}.desk p{line-height:1.55}</style>
